WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:05.640
Hi. This is Michelle with Intentional Travelers&nbsp;
and in this video I’ll be sharing why we started&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:10.080
using SafetyWing for travel medical insurance&nbsp;
and some important things to know about it.&nbsp;

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:14.640
Jedd and I consider ourselves to be&nbsp;
pretty healthy and though we travel often,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:21.060
we don’t tend to do high risk sports or bungee&nbsp;
jumping or things like that. For a long time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:26.880
we only traveled with a very basic medical&nbsp;
evacuation insurance, but once the pandemic hit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:31.140
we felt some risks associated with&nbsp;
travel had increased - not just for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:36.480
our health but the likelihood of logistical&nbsp;
interruptions, delayed flights, lost luggage,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:42.000
etc. - it all compounded and that motivated&nbsp;
us to be more prepared just in case.&nbsp;

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.760
One thing I appreciate most about SafetyWing&nbsp;
is they accommodate long-term travel really&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:53.220
well. That said, you don’t have to travel the&nbsp;
way we do to benefit from their insurance. We&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:59.760
like that SafetyWing is flexible, affordable,&nbsp;
and offers the coverage that most travelers need.&nbsp;

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:02.820
So what is SafetyWing Nomad&nbsp;
Insurance and what does it cover?&nbsp;

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:08.040
It covers you anywhere outside your home country,&nbsp;
with the exception of sanctioned countries like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:14.880
North Korea. It covers unexpected illness or&nbsp;
injury abroad as well as emergency travel benefits&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:21.450
like unplanned overnight stays, evacuation in&nbsp;
the case of local unrest, and lost luggage, etc.&nbsp;

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:24.900
When people started getting stuck&nbsp;
in other countries due to Covid,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:30.720
a lot of insurance providers would not cover&nbsp;
anything Covid-related. But SafetyWing does - they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:35.700
cover treatment and tests for Covid that are&nbsp;
medically necessary, just like any other illness&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:39.240
you might get after you start traveling.
We’ve been lucky so far, but you never&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:43.800
know when you might twist your ankle,&nbsp;
or worse, and it gives peace of mind to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:47.880
have travel insurance so those worst case&nbsp;
scenarios won’t empty your bank account.&nbsp;

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:53.220
Pricing for SafetyWing insurance is based&nbsp;
solely on your age and whether you’ll be in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:57.960
the US or not. You can get a free quote for&nbsp;
your trip through the link below this video&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:03.300
or learn more about what’s covered and how&nbsp;
it works in the detailed review on our blog.

